<h2>The Q Fire Logo</h2>

<p>
    The spinning Q fire logo in the top-left corner is more than just a logo—it's your voice command button. Here's how it works:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Click and hold</strong> – Press and hold the logo (or press and hold the Spacebar) to start recording a voice command</li>
    <li><strong>Speak your request</strong> – While holding, speak what you want Quickfire to do</li>
    <li><strong>Release to send</strong> – Let go of the button (or Spacebar) and your voice command is sent to the AI chat</li>
    <li><strong>Visual feedback</strong> – The logo spins while you're recording, so you know it's working</li>
</ul>

<p>
    This is especially useful when your hands are busy or you want to quickly ask a question without typing. For example, you could hold the logo and say "Show me all renewals expiring this month" and it will navigate you there.
</p>

