<h2>Left Navigation Menu</h2>

<p>
    The left side of the screen has your main navigation menu. These are the primary areas of Quickfire:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Home</strong> – Your daily dashboard with tasks, renewals, and quick-access tiles</li>
    <li><strong>Clients</strong> – All your client records and information</li>
    <li><strong>Renewals</strong> – Policy renewals and the renewal management system</li>
    <li><strong>Leads</strong> – New business opportunities and lead tracking</li>
    <li><strong>Templates</strong> – Email templates for consistent messaging</li>
    <li><strong>Utilities</strong> – Tools and helper functions</li>
    <li><strong>Profile</strong> – Your settings and preferences</li>
</ul>

<p>
    This menu is always visible, so you're never more than one click away from any major area. The current page is highlighted so you always know where you are.
</p>

