<h2>Info and Notifications Area (Bottom Right)</h2>

<p>
    The bottom-right corner of the screen is where Quickfire shows you important information and notifications:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Status messages</strong> – System updates, sync progress, and operational status</li>
    <li><strong>Webhook alerts</strong> – Notifications from integrated services</li>
    <li><strong>Agent updates</strong> – Progress reports when agents are running workflows</li>
    <li><strong>Toast notifications</strong> – Brief messages that appear and then fade away</li>
</ul>

<p>
    These notifications are designed to be informative without blocking your work. They appear in the corner, give you the information you need, and then disappear. You can still interact with the rest of the screen while notifications are showing.
</p>

