<h2>Help Panel</h2>

<p>
    The help panel appears on the right side of the screen and provides context-sensitive help for whatever you're working on. Key features:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Context-aware</strong> – Shows help relevant to the current page or feature</li>
    <li><strong>Collapsible</strong> – Click the chevron (arrow) button to hide it when you need more screen space</li>
    <li><strong>Always available</strong> – Bring it back anytime by clicking the chevron again</li>
    <li><strong>Searchable</strong> – Find help topics quickly</li>
</ul>

<p>
    The help panel is designed to stay out of your way but be there when you need it. If you're working on something and need more screen real estate, just collapse it. When you need guidance, expand it again.
</p>

