<h2>Main Content Area</h2>

<p>
    The center of the screen is where your main work happens. This area changes based on what you're doing:
</p>

<ul>
    <li>When viewing a client, it shows client details, policies, tasks, and files</li>
    <li>When on the homepage, it shows your dashboard widgets</li>
    <li>When working on a renewal, it shows the renewal details, tasks, and submissions</li>
    <li>When searching, it shows search results</li>
</ul>

<p>
    This is your workspace—everything else (navigation, search, help) is designed to support what you're doing in this main area.
</p>

