<h2>Toolbar and Action Buttons</h2>

<p>
    Many pages have a toolbar at the top with action buttons. These buttons give you quick access to common tasks:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Create/Add buttons</strong> – Start new records or add items</li>
    <li><strong>Edit buttons</strong> – Modify existing records</li>
    <li><strong>Agent buttons</strong> – Run automated workflows</li>
    <li><strong>Navigation buttons</strong> – Move between related records</li>
</ul>

<p>
    Toolbars are context-sensitive, so the buttons you see depend on what page you're on and what you're working with.
</p>

