<h2>Tips for Navigation</h2>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Use the search bar</strong> – It's faster than clicking through menus for things you know the name of</li>
    <li><strong>Learn the keyboard shortcuts</strong> – Pressing "/" to search and using arrow keys saves time</li>
    <li><strong>Try voice commands</strong> – When your hands are busy, the Q fire logo voice feature is handy</li>
    <li><strong>Collapse the help panel</strong> – When you need more space, don't hesitate to hide it</li>
    <li><strong>Check notifications</strong> – Glance at the bottom-right occasionally for important updates</li>
</ul>

